      "text": "The problems we now solve by writing code ourselves can be solved by having an AI that writes code. Code is a tool to an end: providing a service, learning new stuff about real world, making decisions. We use code (and will use AI in five years) to make decisions, but making decisions will ultimately be down to humans"
