      "cat": "domain",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 9.0,
      "text": "Figuring out what is actually needed when clients are unclear or aren’t sure themselves. Understanding when things are unethical. Maintaining best practices and security concerns."
