      "cat": "problem",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 27.0,
      "text": "General problem solving, systems design, and interpersonal communication cannot be replaced by an AI as they require active thought, the ability to generate novel solutions, and the ability to understand the needs and desires of people."
