      "role": "mob",
      "roleName": "Mobile",
      "years": 14.0,
      "text": "All of them will continue to be important. With many folks using AI to perform simple tasks, the amount of code and code with bugs due to AI slop will increase by orders of magnitude; it will become evermore apparent who can code and who is just using AI to do their job.\n\nTo benefit from both worlds, systems thinking, to better guide AI agents to do a better job will increase in importance to be even more important but all the rest of the skills: coding, design, algorithms, and especially communication - will continue to be as important as they are today."
