      "text": "Critical thinking, learning, designing and building software/hardware, etc.\nIn 3-5 years, the world won’t look the same, but will work the same.\nMoreover, generative AI has theoretical limits that where not pushed back in the past years (connecting databases with actual data helps a bit). And throwing power at it doesn’t work as well anymore."
