      "id": "r4183",
      "sub": "ai_verify_2",
      "cat": "ai",
      "role": "fe",
      "roleName": "Front-end",
      "years": 4.0,
      "text": "Having a comprehensive and deep understanding of what you are doing is more valuable. Without this, using AI will be like a blind man driving a car."
