      "text": "1) AI is stuck where it is right now, it even degenerate... it's sad but that's it\n2) Coding is a small part of what we do, understanding the business and helping people is what we do\n3) We manage information, AI generates more information, we will have more information to manage... That's our real job at the end of the day.\n\nBasically, we will still manage information in the context of a business, which exists to help people.\n\nThis will not change."
