      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 4.0,
      "text": "All skill will remain valuable if the thing that you make is complex. For me, AI just helping for doing something not complex, or when there is a repetition on the code, like when you code a permissions for many roles that you defined on the system."
