      "cat": "comm",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 1.0,
      "text": "Being able to effectively compose and communicate a solution to management and the customer base will continue to remain essential. For the foreseeable future there will still be a need for developers who can understand problems, not just describe them."
