      "sub": "ai_verify",
      "cat": "ai",
      "role": "mgr",
      "roleName": "Manager",
      "years": 20.0,
      "text": "Adapting to be more efficient by utilizing what AI Tools can provide. Also, expanding how to properly prompt AI LLM tools."
