      "sub": "problem_debug",
      "cat": "problem",
      "role": "be",
      "roleName": "Back-end",
      "years": 5.0,
      "text": "I think AI helps in explaining things or guiding you in specific directions but it generally fails to create bespoke solutions as required. The ability for SWEs to understand the problem and to solve it optimally given some constraints will still be useful."
