      "id": "r4637",
      "sub": "problem_debug",
      "cat": "problem",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 16.0,
      "text": "Yes, very much so. AI is focused on output. Humans can do much more than that. They can solve political problems, build community, encounter solutions they weren't asking for, and improve their own critical thinking. All of these things are things I don't believe AI will ever do, and I believe they are critical for making quality, robust, ethical software."
