      "cat": "fund",
      "role": "emb",
      "roleName": "Embedded",
      "years": 10.0,
      "text": "1. Code optimization is hard and I don't think an AI will know the relevant assumptions in the specific application. 2. The development of new algorithms. 3. Interfacing with complex mathematical problems, as proving implementing numerically correct algorithms is something I don't think AIs will be able to achieve any time soon."
