      "years": 25.0,
      "text": "I have worked with some of the best AI software development solutions.\n\nAll without exception fail at some point, or you end up in situations where AI hallucinates some nonexistent API calls or methods.\n\nAnd as the codebase gets bigger, you lose the ability to maintain the code.\n\nI Think that AI will replace most junior devs, and perhapse some senior too."
