      "text": "unionizing, understanding requirements, but who knows what AI will be capable of doing I guess. cost and time tradeoffs. being able to take direction from AI and work in data centers running cables and sweeping floors. bussing tables, bartending. fixing code that AI generates for lower salary while your manager just keep telling you to AI faster"
