      "text": "I believe we might end up being a business partners more than developers! If that happens, many will lose their jobs, but that means many will fill the internet with useless, unthoughtful apps! Thus, I believe that we, ancient dragons (I mean developers), will still exist!\n\nInterpersonal skills, knowledge transferring and student evaluation, problem-solving, and most creative tasks will remain as they were! AI (the most advanced it can get) will mainly and mostly stay too technical, in my opinion. Only time wilk tell!"
