      "text": "App architecture skills, code literacy, debugging skills all seem like they will remain relevant. You can only have LLMs write apps that you yourself can understand if you want a quality result, so most of a senior developer's skills should still be useful.\n\nWhat bar is set for software quality by different industries into the future is the bigger question to me."
