      "role": "emb",
      "roleName": "Embedded",
      "years": 17.0,
      "text": "Debugging, for a start, is where genAI looks to be least credible in the 5-year timeframe. Next to that, all techniques that ultimately help debugging, first of all writing maintainable code, will also be an asset out of reach of genAI since it is never incentized to write debuggable code. This is particularly true for infrastructure software which is at the intersection of multiple constraints and requirements."
