      "text": "I think low-overhead libraries will be the most important tool for developers going forward. While I personally don't use a lot of libraries, they seem to outpace the capabilities of AI. As a matter of fact, most of the recent A.I. demos I've witnessed are doing nothing more than loading libraries."
