      "text": "The same that was required before.  AI tools help me look at the problem differently, but often the answers fall into patterns that don't apply in my industry or application, so I have to still understand the problem and navigate to the best answer.  Like code from another developer, I have to review and spot errors that often appear, but the code is still helpful.  I usually have to nudge the AI to give me code the way I want it (without external libraries) and rewrite it to match my coding style."
