      "role": "be",
      "roleName": "Back-end",
      "years": null,
      "text": "I think the skills that would stay the most valuable even after AI tools become more capable are\n1) The ability of a person to visualize and design complex solutions for a problem.\n2) The skill needed to work on novel technologies that are being created using trial and errors"
