      "text": "1. System Design and Architecture\n\nAI can generate code, but it doesn’t fully understand trade-offs in scalability, reliability, or long-term maintenance.\n\n2. Problem-Solving and Critical Thinking\n\nFraming the right problem and breaking it down into solvable units is a human skill. AI can help implement, but not define.\n\n3. DevOps and Automation\n\nEven with AI-assisted coding, CI/CD pipelines, container orchestration, and deployment management remain essential for delivery."
