      "text": "AI will not be able to create something completly unique or new. The Idea of what you need and how you want to interact will still be from my mind. It will be like AI Image or Video Generation. Yes AI can create Images from Prompts. But it will only generate the image i am imagining, if i can describe my thoughts very precise."
