      "cat": "ai",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 4.0,
      "text": "I highly doubt that AI tools will produce code of the quality that a human can provide. So writing quality code will be a vital skill. Developing in large code bases will also challenge AI tools."
