      "text": "Ability to use AI tools effectively.\nAbility to understand the code generated by AI and the \"big picture\" of a codebase - best practices, architecture, patterns, etc.\nCommunication skills, self-expression.\nThinking outside the box - generating new solutions that aren't part of existing AI's training dataset."
