      "cat": "problem",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": null,
      "text": "Critical Thinking and Software Analysis, Critical thinking meaning being able to think about the code without actually writing the full method out and \"designing\" it in your head ahead of time. Software analysis as in the documentation and group work in development."
