      "years": 20.0,
      "text": "Knowing how the pieces fit together from complete business perspective. \nBeing able to interpret what the client actually needs, not what they say they need. \nIDing and compensating for edge use cases.\nManaging UX for everything. AI is not a real user.\nCoding for specific environments and then applying that to a different environment.\nTroubleshooting poorly reported use issues (ITS BROKEN - FIX IT)\nJust being able to talk to a person in a world of talking to automated machines systems."
