      "cat": "domain",
      "role": "fe",
      "roleName": "Front-end",
      "years": 14.0,
      "text": "Being able to think about and understand a project at a scale that isn't limited by an arbitrary context window size.  Being able to actually understand concepts in the world and not just be a fancy autocomplete."
