      "text": "ability to understand business and user requirements and translate them into a proposed solution; ability and supporting knowledge and experience to assess the quality of AI generated code; architectural knowledge (and other abstract systems knowledge) to be confident AI is working towards the right high-level end result; ability to learn new technologies (eg. frameworks) before there is sufficient training data available for AI to become proficient in them"
