      "years": 30.0,
      "text": "'- Sapere aude! (Think for yourself!/  \"Have courage to use your own reason!\")\n- evaluating code / output \n- coding for \"rare cases\"\n- generate primary data\n-  (I/O interface) hardware-/ sensor-adaptive optimization, creating hardware interfaces / embedded systems design\n- Co-Coding (with human and AI partners)\n- e.g, reduce power consumption of final app by brushing up AI-generated code (hard to identify, co-coding presumably)\n- identifying mishabs like Halluzinations \n- ML/DeepLearning data generation / inference data\n- AI model input data optimization (quality and ethical standards)\n- defining data domains\n- maintenance of legacy systems\n- (co-)engineering of adaptive hard- and software (NPU.., compilers, ..)"
