      "id": "r9791",
      "sub": "problem_debug",
      "cat": "problem",
      "role": "mob",
      "roleName": "Mobile",
      "years": 11.0,
      "text": "Problem solving in general will still play a huge role and if people give AI tools autonomy, they will inevitably generate slop which would still require human intervention. Understanding concepts and predicting the impact of code added by other entities, designing structures to play well with both humans and slop will play a huge part going forward as well"
