      "cat": "problem",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 47.0,
      "text": "Debugging: Describing the problem, isolating the problem, selecting a solution, and recognizing whether a solution addresses the problem. AI still needs a human to do these things. AI may generate solutions, but a human still has to decide whether the AI's solution is a solution to the problem."
