      "cat": "domain",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 13.0,
      "text": "Understanding the history of the codebase and the context for why decisions were made and what implicit limits are on the system that are not clear in the code. Also, interacting between technical and non-technical users, and negotiating the scope of work."
