      "text": "The myth of AI tools is decimating the junior to senior developer pipeline while simultaneously creating unprecedented levels of unmaintainable code. In 3-5 years, I expect senior+ developer salaries to significantly increase as there will be many fewer experienced devs and the amount of work available increases."
