      "text": "I think the AI hype will fade like the blockchain hype did. In the end we will have some sane usage of generative AI (chatbots, auto-complete/suggestion, reworking or translating texts...) \nI am sure some people will still use AI as an expansion of no/low code development or to help non professional developers.\nBut for the most part I don't expect any significant change regarding the skills needed to be a good developer as at the very least you should be able to understand and fix anything you may decide to ask Ai to produce."
