      "text": "Vibe coding might become more prevalent, but knowledgeable developers will still be valuable. Being able to generate code without knowledge is \"easy\", being able to use, extend, and fix code, that'll be the hard part. AI will likely be able to reason when it comes to a small codebase, but actual real-world codebases, I don't believe AI will be able to replace developers there."
