      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 4.0,
      "text": "Most critical will be software taste. Making software that is ergonomic and still efficient/robust is hard, and AI doesn't seem good at maximizing for both at once.\nIdeation also requires taste - AI can get from point A -> B, but if you don't know what a good final result should look like, then it's pointless."
