      "text": "Understanding the code is still essential. The AI tools sometimes provide inaccurate descriptions of the code they have written, making it difficult to debug if you are not familiar with it.\nBeing able to describe the structure of the project and the design patterns you want to implement is very important, even if the AI tool does the coding. Without a clear plan, the AI tool will not be able to generate a codebase which aligns with your goals."
