      "role": "be",
      "roleName": "Back-end",
      "years": 2.0,
      "text": "Comprehensive understanding of the codebase, the business domain and communication with different stakeholders. Ability to review code, as well as taste in what good code looks like. Vision for the code base in terms of style, structure, architecture, etc."
