      "text": "Thinking and actually being able to solve problems in new ways. There is a surplus of mindless coding. We need problem solvers, not solution implementers. Creative and transformative innovation is something LLM's are exceptionally bad at and will likely get worse as peoples pathological use of LLM's for purposes it is not suited for flood the internet with hard to detect low quality and inaccurate information."
