      "roleName": "Back-end",
      "years": 30.0,
      "text": "The ability to clearly express an AI request remains a barrier for some developers. The quality of the AI supplied code quality remains in direct proportion to the quality of the question.\nI have also observed that AIs like Copilot and Genie will almost always provide solutions to requests, even when the premise of the request is inadvisable, so developers must apply good judgement."
