      "text": "learning how to use AI tools to improve.  Currently you'll search google, stack overflow and other places for answers, but that doesn't mean everything provided works or works in your case, and it's the same with AI, you have to still have to problem solve and merge the best working solution, it's just how your gather that reference data."
