      "years": 11.0,
      "text": "Creative and problem-solving skills will always be in demand. I don't believe AI will be able to effectively manage large legacy codebases, given its current limitations in understanding complex contexts. Additionally, I don't think we will achieve artificial general intelligence (AGI) or superintelligence within the next 3 to 5 years."
