      "role": "devops",
      "roleName": "DevOps",
      "years": null,
      "text": "Low level programming, most AI tools are noticeably worse at that, probably due to the lack of bad code in that domain on the internet.\n\nRAGs, I think there is a certain difficulty in getting AI to automate itself, probably due to the receny of the technology. I think it can be helpful creating RAGs but will not completely automate it.\n\nDevOps. I think (especially smaller) companies will continue to distrust unconcious machines in critical production level environments, although a lot of devops work will be automated."
