      "text": "Debugging skills, threat analysis, formal reasoning, and communication.  AI systems are producing fewer obvious errors, but they continue to produce many subtle ones.  As people trust them more, the ability of developers to discern and articulate the risks and problems associated with AI systems will become increasingly important."
