      "cat": "comm",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 22.0,
      "text": "In the next 3–5 years, developers with strong fundamentals in algorithms, system design, and problem-solving will remain in demand, as these skills go beyond what AI can automate. Debugging, architecture decisions, and translating business needs into technical solutions will still require human judgment.\n\nSoft skills like communication, collaboration, and ethical thinking will also be essential, especially in cross-functional teams and AI-integrated projects. Developers who adapt and use AI as a tool—not a crutch—will thrive."
