      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 21.0,
      "text": "Understanding of business problems and creating solutions / systems will still be the most important thing.\n\nCoding skills will also stay relevant, although the focus might switch even more into reading / understanding code instead of actual coding in a world where much code will be generated by AI. Also, debugging unknown (AI generated) code will get important.\n\nAlso reading documentation will remain a super-power. (Devs already do not value documentation enough, with AI this will get even worse)"
