      "text": "Organization and building scalable projects is the most clear example I can think of. Many times AI can add new features withouting rewriting the whole structure/existing code and many times deletes features while doing so and creates bugs elsewhere. Developers that don't completely understand how their project is structure also won't be able to further expand on it."
