      "text": "Business Analysis - software developers who are better able to translate business problems into software problems for AI assistants to tackle will be valuable.\n\nCode Literacy - software developers who are capable of reading and understanding code written with a greater number of design patterns and in a greater number of languages will be valuable as they will be capable of inspecting AI output more effectively."
