      "cat": "fund",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 2.0,
      "text": "A strong understanding of LLM and agentic fundamentals. How they are developed, how they got to where they are now, understanding how the work. Knowing what data is used to train the tools they are using.\nGeneral problem solving and reasoning skills.\nStrong fundamental knowledge behind coding languages, why and how they work. \nUnderstanding architecture from both a low level and high level perspective.\nCode comprehension, why it works, what downstream effects it may have, any security concerns, does the code fit within the code base."
