      "cat": "fund",
      "role": "be",
      "roleName": "Back-end",
      "years": 11.0,
      "text": "Ability to interact with new APIs, ability to optimize software by pulling in additional outside constraints, ability to recognize when real mathematics is called for and the ability to do said mathematics."
