      "years": 11.0,
      "text": "Ability to  grasp the full context or nuances of a problem. \nMake trade-offs between performance, cost, and complexity. \nAbility to understand the customer's ask. Is there a better solution? (e.g. Customer asks for a link to be displayed to a pdf so they can add it to a different doc. Developer can eliminate a step and combine the docs dynamically.) Solving symptoms vs underling cause. Expanding solution to other areas."
