      "sub": "design_arch_6",
      "cat": "design",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 14.0,
      "text": "All skills. AI tools are incapable of understanding the full context, so developers will never not need to know how to architect, write, and debug their own code in response to problems they will never not need to know how to triage and solve. Every skill an AI replaces is a piece lost from the larger skill pool a developer needs to be considered competent at their job."
