      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 9.0,
      "text": "The ability to break down complex features into smaller, easier to tackle problems, soft skills like communicating clearly (both in writing and in speaking), working effectively with other people, understanding the bigger picture and context behind a decision, the intuition and experience to check in code that edge cases and unhappy paths are also handled effectively, and not just overlooked by the AI tool (trust but verify)."
