      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 20.0,
      "text": "I don't believe that AI will become \"more capable\" in the sense that is being hyped: the probabilistic nature of the models are unsuited to the production of code, which is provable and \"deterministic\". Reliance on such tools will likely dull the ability to troubleshoot & debug, in the individual; in the organization, \"AI\" will encourage administrators & managers to discount and ignore experience and further encourage thinking of people as replaceable, I expect massive losses of institutional knowledge."
