      "text": "Being able to use the right words to get the AI to generate the code that actually works and that's very difficult for complex solutions.\n\nI just had a situation where i asked an 'enterprise ready' team of AI personas to analyse a stored proc and they 'fixed' it to the point it tanked the (dev) server and i had to revert it because it was garbage.  When i asked it why, it said that they had written something for enterprise.  \n\nThere are nuances in english that even I as a native english person with a high level of education may understand differently than the AI."
