      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 14.0,
      "text": "translating domain-specific knowledge into complex business logic (AI reasoning will not evolve enough to work well here), fixing the really difficult bugs, security becomes even more important, orchestrating software architecture, making decisions that have impact, knowing tool/model limits and intuitively which tool/model works best for which task, maintaining AI prompt liberies, MCP servers settings, etc."
