      "text": "Most valuable will probably be problem-solving. If AI is a tool, it will still need to be effectively applied (and reviewed) to complex + abstract situations. \"Coding\" might be done less and less, but people are called \"Software Architects\" and \"Developers\", not \"Coders\" - the value of our profession is not defined by the quantity of lines of code."
