      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 10.0,
      "text": "I don't think AI tools will significantly become more capable, it seems to be a hype bubble and they can't even match a junior coder due to the complete lack of logical reasoning capability. There is no indication there is currently an approach on the horizon that will manage to fix this. See Apple's recent study. \"Apple's research seemed to show damning evidence about the limitations of reasoning model intelligence\" (Source: mashable.com)"
