      "cat": "ai",
      "role": "mgr",
      "roleName": "Manager",
      "years": 40.0,
      "text": "AI tools are just another programming language.  All the same skills will be necessary.  We will just do less grunt work.  As an analogy, humans still use shovels along with their large tractors"
