      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 25.0,
      "text": "Software engineering, i.e. knowing how to work in a team on development of software in all phases: planning, requirements gathering, design, implementation, and quality assurance. Knowing the best processes, roles, and responsibilities is still the best way to produce quality software."
