      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 4.0,
      "text": "Critical thinking and complete software engineering skills. In order to guide AI to produce good code, that follows best practices and software patterns, first, the developer needs to know about them. And then, he needs to be able to look at the code and verify that the AI produced code that follows said best practices and applies the mentioned software patterns"
