      "text": "Software architecture and design.  AI still sucks at creating extensibility, which is software that is designed to be extendible in order to meet future requirements. Only a skilled human can optimize the design trade offs between rigid simplicity and hyper customizable complexity. Only a skilled human can empathize with the end-user to find a design that they will enjoy using."
