      "text": "Creativity, flexibility, and personality will all be key skills in the future. AI is very powerful and will be able to out code us with enough time, but being able to shift between logic and brainstorming (or helping a client understand what they actually want or need) is going to be important. Clients will often bring an idea to the table that they don't understand, and through discussion and willingness to communicate we bring the real idea out and that is often in a completely different direction. AI would take that initial information they brought to the table and rub them into the ground with it."
