      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 6.0,
      "text": "You're going to need to look ahead further than that. The systems you're talking about are not going to become capable. Skills like critical thinking, clear thinking, and not gleefully jumping on every rickety bandwagon will be valuable. Learn Emacs."
