      "id": "r19076",
      "sub": "comm_requirements_4",
      "cat": "comm",
      "role": "fs",
      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 12.0,
      "text": "In the next 3–5 years, skills like problem-solving, critical thinking, understanding system architecture, and effective communication will stay valuable. Also, knowing how to work alongside AI tools, review and improve AI-generated code, and focus on ethics and security will be key. Human creativity and collaboration can’t be fully replaced."
