      "roleName": "DevOps",
      "years": 12.0,
      "text": "All of them, as I do not believe AI will be capable of performing most coding tasks at professional standards for mission critical applications within 5 years. But especially: code review, to fix the robots' output; security, where small errors remain very costly; and performance-critical or specialized platform code, which do not have large bases of training material."
