      "roleName": "Full-stack",
      "years": 13.0,
      "text": "Software development, as it pertains to interfacing with the business and translating organizational needs to structured plans will still be needed. The technical barrier from \"what is needed\" to \"what gets produced\". Being able to guide non-technical stakeholders to a usable and intuitive software solution will remain valuable. Keeping developer resources focused and efficient, especially with the help of AI will still be needed. And lastly, the ability to be accountable for a codebase, for security, auditing and peace of mind."
