      "years": 8.0,
      "text": "Two important engineering skills are learning quickly and the ability to deeply debug and understand a problem. Engineers will still need to learn quickly and understand problems at a deep level.\n\nIn fact, because AI code is by definition a bit less trustworthy and hard to debug since your colleagues did not write it, the ability to deeply understand and debug complex systems will become even more valuable."
