      "text": "I think that all current skills will still be valuable, but some skills will become more valuable, maybe debugging and more soft skills, but coding will still be very immportant, as I don't think in 5 years AI will be capable of complitely maintaining code as complex as the ones being used by the biggest companies, also it may be the case that for smaller companies the cost for these tools be too high"
